   "speaker": "",
   "role": "MPC minutes",
   "kind": "other",
   "paraphrase": "Four policymakers (Anna Breman, Carl Hansen, Prasanna Gai, Rebecca Williams) backed leaving the OCR unchanged; Paul Conway, Hayley Gourley and Karen Silk backed a hike.",
